# Bindings.xml is deliberately absent. The client loads it by that name from the addon's
# root folder on its own, before it reads this file; naming it here hands the same file to
# the ordinary UI XML parser as well, which does not know what a <Binding> is and reports
# it as unrecognised XML at every login.
